OL,3,GNEWSARed Devils display over bay
OL,4,Acancelled over rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Devils' parachute display over
OL,7,FDouglas Bay has been cancelled due to
OL,8,Frain being forecast.
OL,10,FNo jumps are allowed to take place
OL,11,Fduring poor weather conditions, and
OL,12,Fshowers are expected later this
OL,13,Fafternoon.
OL,15,FThe world-famous British Army display
OL,16,Fteam had been due to perform at 19:30
OL,17,FBST, with a jump over Douglas Bay and a
OL,18,Fbeach landing opposite the Villa
OL,19,FMarina.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
