OL,3,GNEWSARed Devils display over bay
OL,4,Acancelled over rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows the announcement that the
OL,7,FManx Grand Prix and Classic TT races
OL,8,Fwere cancelled from Tuesday onwards,
OL,9,Fafter poor weather was forecast.
